        "original_id": "f4eb8633-dc46-5a50-9eb0-a813f3179db6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Crowded Sky, The Best Years of Our Lives\n- People: Joseph Pevney, Dana Andrews, Rhonda Fleming, Efrem Zimbalist Jr., Hank Searls\n- Topics: American film actors, Hollywood stars\n\nFacts:\n- Dana Andrews was born on January 1, 1909, and he became a major American film star during the 1940s.\n- Dana Andrews received his most praise for playing war veteran Fred Derry in The Best Years of Our Lives (1946).\n- The Crowded Sky is a 1960 Technicolor drama film directed by Joseph Pevney and starring Dana Andrews, Rhonda Fleming, and Efrem Zimbalist Jr.\n- The Crowded Sky is based on the novel of the same name by Hank Searls.\n- Dana Andrews died on December 17, 1992.",
